+`*-kompiled` directories or caches was copied. The copied-source hashes are in
+[`evidence/01-scratch-copy.log`](evidence/01-scratch-copy.log). The live tools
+are K 7.1.293
+([`evidence/03-toolchain.log`](evidence/03-toolchain.log)).
+
