+returned status 130. Selecting only SPEC.get-positive also excludes the
+SPEC.filter-loop circularity on which the entry proof depends, so this is not
+the candidate's complete target-proof command and is not treated as a failed
+positive claim. The complete SPEC module, containing both claims, was run
+separately and is recorded in 03-kprove-complete-spec.log.
